MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Elvis 30 #1 Hits and The Very Best of the Spinners feel like natural next choices because I repeatedly return to collections of familiar songs from earlier decades.",
    "Phoebe Snow fits the singer-songwriter appeal of Melanie, Jonathan Edwards, and Simon & Garfunkel, while A Very Special Christmas 2 directly continues my latest holiday listening."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The 20/20 Experience, x, and Title connect with my occasional newer pop listening, but that connection feels weaker than my repeated interest in older hits and singer-songwriters.",
    "Crazy Ex-Girlfriend gives me too little recognizable connection to my current interests. Merry Christmas II You fits my holiday mood, but the follow-up to a compilation I recently chose feels more compelling."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in Born This Way seems to carry too much weight compared with my many choices of older music and hits collections.",
    "Enjoying expressive vocals does not mean every pop or soulful vocal album feels equally relevant; 19 appeals to me, but it is a lower priority right now."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated choices of best-of albums and decade compilations suggest that familiar songs collected together matter to me, beyond simply liking an artist or style.",
    "My latest choice of A Very Special Christmas makes its sequel especially timely, while my earlier singer-songwriter listening still makes Phoebe Snow a strong match."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly capture my interest in older hits and holiday music, but give occasional newer pop choices more influence than they have on what I want now."
}
